meta {
  name: Biodun
  seq: 5
}

docs {
  Biodun — developer with a 12-unit block in Ojodu Berger.
  Time is scarce. He wants volume listing, delegation to Emeka,
  and status visibility across many listings without taking
  inspection calls.

  Journey (this run): register OWNER → submit identity → admin
  approves → create 3 properties → publish 3 listings (incl
  cautionFee:0 sanity check) → /properties/mine → /listings/mine
  → register Emeka (AGENT) + admin-approve → request Emeka
  on a listing → register an applicant + submit offer → check
  notifications with ?kind=OFFER_SUBMITTED filter → mark-all-read
  → accept the offer → verify listing auto-closes to CLOSED.
}
